check 1
# Act II hire (q-chk-hirelings, REC-1515): hire from the Act 2 seller (npc 198) through the
# client's NPC flow, one C->S message per frame: 0x13 interact (world/npc.md §2),
# 0x2F chat open (§3), 0x36 hire (§7.3) of the first name of the seller's row
# (string id 1019; an offered=0 slot is accepted). Level-30 expansion Barbarian
# with 100000 gold (price vs. gold: vendors.md §9.1). Compares the hire result,
# the created hireling (hirelings.md §3, §4) and the 0x81/0x9E stat messages'
# state, then 60 frames of its follow AI. The player is poked next to the seller
# (poke goto unit 1:198).
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name hire-greiz
save ScnHi2 --class bar --expansion --level 30 --gold 100000 --act 1
seed 1234
ticks 90
seconds 400
channels state packets
at 4 poke goto unit 1:198
at 8 send InteractWithEntity type=1 id=@1:198
at 10 send InitEntityChat id=@1:198
at 14 send HireMerc npc=@1:198 merc=1019
